# Reclamation Specialist may sacrifice itself: the cost says "an artifact creature", not "another" (CR 602.2b, 118.3).
# The Mox Jet beside it is only an artifact and the Llanowar Elves only a creature, so neither can pay; the Specialist is
# the single legal choice and the ability resolves with the Specialist in the graveyard and the pool empty.

